msgid ":q closes the window (:q! without asking about its tabs), :qa quits Beluga, :e or :cd PATH opens a folder, :tabnew [PATH], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp or :vs [PATH] split the view, :only closes the other view, :mkdir NAME, :touch NAME, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!COMMAND runs a shell command in the folder."
msgstr ":q fecha a janela (:q! sem perguntar pelos separadores), :qa sai do Beluga, :e ou :cd CAMINHO abre uma pasta, :tabnew [CAMINHO], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp ou :vs [CAMINHO] dividem a vista, :only fecha a outra vista, :mkdir NOME, :touch NOME, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!COMANDO executa um comando da shell na pasta."

